      </div>
      <details class="plain-disclosure">
        <summary>Why the ownership mix totals 100%</summary>
        <p>The bar uses two non-overlapping categories: reported institutional ownership and all other shareholders. Insider ownership and mutual fund ownership are shown as separate analytical indicators and must not be added to the bar; mutual funds are already included within institutional ownership. Regulatory filings describe historical reported positions, not live holdings.</p>
      </details>
    </div>

    <details class="ownership-detail">
      <summary><span>Insider activity</span><span>{insider12Month ? `${fmtSignedDollar(netInsiderValue(insider12Month))} net · 12 months` : "No summary available"}</span></summary>
    <div class="card ownership-detail-body">
      <p class="card-description">Open-market trades by officers, directors, and major owners. Routine grants and tax transactions are excluded from the headline.</p>
      {insider12Month && (
        <div class="signal-grid">
          <div class="signal-card signal-card--primary">
            <span class="ownership-stat-label">Net buying · 12 months</span>
            <strong class={netInsiderValue(insider12Month) > 0 ? "value-positive" : netInsiderValue(insider12Month) < 0 ? "value-negative" : undefined}>{fmtSignedDollar(netInsiderValue(insider12Month))}</strong>
            <span class="ownership-stat-meta">Buys minus sells</span>
          </div>
          <div class="signal-card">
            <span class="ownership-stat-label">Insiders buying</span>
            <strong>{insider12Month.insiders_buying_count}</strong>
            <span class="ownership-stat-meta">vs {insider12Month.insiders_selling_count} selling</span>
          </div>
          <div class="signal-card">
            <span class="ownership-stat-label">Largest purchase</span>
            <strong>{insider12Month.largest_purchase_value ? `$${fmtNum(insider12Month.largest_purchase_value)}` : "—"}</strong>
            <span class="ownership-stat-meta">{insider12Month.largest_purchase_owner_name ?? "No purchase reported"}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      )}
      {insiderWindowSummary.length > 0 && (
        <details class="data-disclosure">
